  m_Name: SeaWharf
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::BuildingDefinition
  id: SeaWharf
  displayName: Wharf
  description: 'A timber wharf and a warehouse of amphorae; round-bellied merchant
    ships tie up alongside. Build one in two of your towns on the same water and
    merchant ships sail between them: coin and goods every voyage, more for long
    routes between big towns. Pirates prey on them; lighthouses and warships keep
    them safer. Each upgrade opens one more route.'
